      {
        "key": "t01_clinical",
        "text": "I am 63 and finished a 7-day course of clindamycin for a dental abscess 5 days ago. For the past 2 days I have had watery diarrhea 4 times a day with mild abdominal cramping. What should I eat or take at home?",
