        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t07_clinical",
        "text": "Since this morning I have had hemorrhagic diarrhea 6 times with bright red blood, my fever jumped to 39.2 °C, and when I stood up from the toilet I had brief syncope on the bathroom rug.",
