        "authored_by": "synthetic_example"
      },
      {
        "key": "t07_colloquial",
        "text": "since this morning ive had bloody diarrhea 6 times with bright red blood, my fever shot up to 39.2 C, and when i stood up from the toilet i fell out briefly on the bathroom rug.",
